32:  *          per-dab stamp (ctx.dabGen / ctx.curDabGen) via grabClaimFirstTouch,
33:  *          so mirror-only verts re-base every dab (no cross-dab accumulation)
34:  *          while shared seam verts still get orig + Σ disp_i within one dab. */
